depends 2180idle
# at this point we've expunged a couple of messages. we now append a
# new message, expect a new EXISTS, and react to the EXISTS with a UID
# FETCH.
receive 1
+ idling
use main
send 6
a append INBOX () {123+}
From: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
To: Arnt Gulbrandsen <arnt@oryx.com>
Date: Thu, 13 May 2004 14:28:51 +0200

asdf
receive 3
* 5 EXISTS
* OK [UIDNEXT 7] next uid
a OK [APPENDUID 1 6] done
use watcher
receive 3
* 5 EXISTS
* 2 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 7] next uid
send 2
done
b uid fetch 5 (uid modseq flags)
receive 3
i OK done
* 4 FETCH (UID 5 FLAGS (\Recent) MODSEQ (8))
b OK done
end
